        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Available</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Valley Beyond demo takes place in a small part of the map: West Beach and Black Island. Eight artworks to collect. Enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/b0f997e2138256a2d02895c8a99377d4.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1200 height=900 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace:</strong> Discover a peaceful and gorgeous world, free from any pressure. There are no enemies or time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/a2faa6adca275f52304cb99fbd3bdeb1.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Explorer: </strong>No interface or quest markers here to show you the way. Your curiosity will be your only guide, and forging a path to certain places will be a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras_big/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559 width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe and Solve</strong>: The artworks offer you fairly simple puzzles to solve. It's up to you to understand their logic to activate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/c9045030af140044680245eff08710dd.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World with a Past:</strong>  Find the audio logs and piece together what happened in the park before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/43dc6a00a9b284dc0f3f0ab97c28bef0.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect New Abilities: </strong>Find equipment to help you climb, glide, or light your way to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore at Your Own Pace:</strong> Discover a peaceful and gorgeous world, free from any pressure. There are no enemies or time limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/a2faa6adca275f52304cb99fbd3bdeb1.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A True Explorer: </strong>No interface or quest markers here to show you the way. Your curiosity will be your only guide, and forging a path to certain places will be a real challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras_big/8e5cb90fd390e3e27e93a17a794be3a7.avif?t=1771923559 width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe and Solve</strong>: The artworks offer you fairly simple puzzles to solve. It's up to you to understand their logic to activate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/c9045030af140044680245eff08710dd.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World with a Past:</strong>  Find the audio logs and piece together what happened in the park before your arrival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3889780/extras/43dc6a00a9b284dc0f3f0ab97c28bef0.avif?t=1771923559\" width=1560 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect New Abilities: </strong>Find equipment to help you climb, glide, or light your way to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Combining exploration, puzzles, and platforming, The Valley Beyond sends you on vacation to a gorgeous park filled with works of art. But something is wrong, and you soon realize there’s no way out. To escape, you’ll have to uncover all of the park’s secrets.",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
